# FramePilot — environment template
#
# This release needs NO environment variables.
#
# FramePilot is mock-first: all direction is generated by a deterministic local
# engine, and everything you save is kept in your browser's localStorage. There
# are no API routes, no model calls, no external services, and no database, so
# there is nothing to configure here.
#
# Copying this file is optional. `npm install && npm run dev` is enough, and
# Vercel needs no variables set for a successful build.
#
# Kept as a placeholder for the future server-side model route described in the
# README's "Future work" section. When that lands, its key would live here — and
# only ever be read on the server, never exposed to the browser.
#
# Example of the shape that phase would take (commented out, not in use):
# MODEL_API_KEY=
